// Signing, kept out of the committed project.
//
// Picking a team in Xcode's Signing & Capabilities tab writes
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM straight into project.pbxproj, which is committed — so a
// clone would carry one person's team and fail to build for everyone else.
// This repository's promise is that anyone can clone it and press Run.
//
// The include below is optional (note the `?`): without the local file there
// is no team and no warning, which is exactly right for someone who has just
// cloned this and only wants the simulator.
//
// To sign on a real device, create Signing.local.xcconfig beside this file:
//
//     DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = YOURTEAMID
//
// It is ignored by git. Do not add your team to this file.
#include? "Signing.local.xcconfig"
